  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This dynamic, 3D-printed RC racer remixes the classic CyberBrick™ SoccerBot, swapping the ball launcher for an exciting disc shooter. Battle solo or head-to-head, using lightweight or mediumweight discs for strategic play. With a 20-disc capacity and intuitive controls, it’s perfect for fast-paced competitive or cooperative action. Build, customize, and dominate the arena!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Ideal for makers, gamers, and collectors — unleash your battlefield creativity with CyberBrick!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files and obtain detailed information, please visit the DodgeBot for CyberBrick on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p>This dynamic, 3D-printed RC racer remixes the classic CyberBrick™ SoccerBot, swapping the ball launcher for an exciting disc shooter. Battle solo or head-to-head, using lightweight or mediumweight discs for strategic play. With a 20-disc capacity and intuitive controls, it’s perfect for fast-paced competitive or cooperative action. Build, customize, and dominate the arena!</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Ideal for makers, gamers, and collectors — unleash your battlefield creativity with CyberBrick!</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">To download the model files and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong>DodgeBot for CyberBrick </strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1405319-dodgebot-for-cyberbrick?from=search#profileId-1458058\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a>.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-container\"><div class=\"VideoWrapper\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/x9pweC1sTFM?si=x-8nHZprcjnwQIeD\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h1 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">In the Box</h1>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 285px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Item Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Quantity</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/cyberbrick-hardware-kit?id=593289489201844227&amp;skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">CyberBrick Ultimate Hardware Kit -ZK003 (2 Remotes, 2 Cars)</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/rubber-bands?id=46239016583408\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">1.4x20mm Basic Rubber Bands (100PCS) - RA002</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This dynamic, 3D-printed RC racer remixes the classic CyberBrick™ SoccerBot, swapping the ball launcher for an exciting disc shooter. Battle solo or head-to-head, using lightweight or mediumweight discs for strategic play. With a 20-disc capacity and intuitive controls, it’s perfect for fast-paced competitive or cooperative action. Build, customize, and dominate the arena!\n\nIdeal for makers, gamers, and collectors — unleash your battlefield creativity with CyberBrick!\n\nTo download the model files and obtain detailed information, please visit the DodgeBot for CyberBrick on MakerWorld.",
